membrain-benchmark
The MemBrain benchmark: a synthetic interference benchmark for agent memory,
the harness that measured every retrieval and write-time arm on it, the
result files, and the paper "MemBrain: An Agent Memory Built on the Brain,
and What the Measurements Said".

