THIRD-PARTY MATERIAL

The benchmark corpora under data/corpus/ are synthetic and were generated for
this repository; they contain no third-party text. The cached model responses
under data/cache/ are answers to prompts built from those corpora. The
generators, harness, figures and result files are authored here, and are
covered by the Apache License.

Dependencies are exact-pinned in pyproject.toml and are installed from PyPI
under their own licences. The encoder all-MiniLM-L6-v2 (Apache-2.0) is
downloaded from Hugging Face at run time and is not redistributed here.

The LoCoMo benchmark (snap-research/locomo) is not redistributed. The external
experiment clones it at run time, at a pinned commit checked against a pinned
SHA-256, into the gitignored data/external/. Its use is governed by its own
licence. The files results/convention-external/ and results/incumbents/ report
metrics computed on LoCoMo; they contain no LoCoMo text, and the data they
were computed from stays under LoCoMo's own terms.
